      "problem": "Absence of baseline and follow-up lab results to screen for TDF/3TC/DTG toxicity",
      "action": "Order renal function (creatinine/eGFR), liver function tests, and HIV viral load as part of routine monitoring on ART.",
      "reason": "No past or latest lab results are recorded, and guideline excerpts reference contraindications and screening for DTG and other ART toxicities that require lab-based assessment.",
      "clinician_plan_for_this_problem": {
        "decision": "Not Addressed",
